<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italian 10-YR BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italian 10-YR BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) carrying a 6.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   February 1, 2007   previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.32 pct vs	6.17 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.22 pct vs	7.06 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  97.50    vs     98.60</p>
<p> Bids		 3.586 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   2.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with the previous auction of a third tranche of the 10-year Btp on February 13.</p>
</text>
